  "content": "\n\n<h2>LazyDFU Reloaded</h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>如果您尚未找到所需的模組版本，您可以到我的 Modrinth 頁面查找。</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flazydfu-reloaded%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a></span></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組為內容創作者<strong>astei</strong>所開發之 LazyDFU 模組的非官方移植版。目前已新增對<strong>Forge</strong>、<strong>NeoForge</strong>模組載入器的支援，並將 Fabric 支援更新至較新版本。此外，資源包的載入與卸載流程也進一步最佳化。</p>\n<p><strong>原始模組連結</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flazydfu\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/lazydfu</a></p>\n<p><strong>作者連結</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fastei\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/user/astei</a></p>",
